Radio stations
--------------
config/sources.yml only points at public stream URLs run by third parties
(for example SomaFM, WDCB, All Classical Portland, France Musique, Lofi Girl,
Chillhop). No audio from them is bundled or redistributed. Each stream stays
under its own operator's terms; please support the stations you enjoy. The
list of stream URLs started from the public source list of the community
"claude-music" plugin.

Bundled assets
--------------
assets/chime.wav is generated for this project (two sine tones) and is
released under the same Apache-2.0 license.

Tools it can call (not bundled, installed by you)
-------------------------------------------------
ffplay (FFmpeg, LGPL/GPL) and yt-dlp (Unlicense). They run as separate
processes on your machine; nothing of them is copied into this repository.
